ation as well with the fantastic  addition and online play  the drivers that you will see in the  world can be all real players online  and the experience is enhanced with the  all-new forza link  now forza link is the ai that  intelligently interacts on your behalf  with the game world  through it you can set markers on the  gps communicate with nearby drivers  and even challenge them to erase all on  the go while you're exploring the  environment  even more impressive is that forza link  can study the data of each driver  and give suggestions based on what it  knows about your driving habits and  those of the players around you  in one example they show that a player  has an affinity for the arcade minigames  and suggests to the main player to  specifically invite them to play those  minigames  creating a greater chance that the  matchmaking requests will be accepted  the standout feature for me when it  comes to gameplay modes  is the chance it offers for players to  create entertaining original arcade  minigames of their own  through the brand new events lab this  completely new tool set allows players  to create their own game modes  races and mini games you can customize  everything  including the rules and events lab is  based on playground game's own internal  design tools  and has been repackaged and fit to be  digestible for regular players but don't  think that events lab is limited in  possibility  not only can you just set up your own  mini games but you can even alter the  physics of the game like making the cars  heavier  or reduce the gravity the customization  is expected to be  deep and that is really exciting lastly  we have horizon  open and tour both attempting to  redefine the traditional experiences in  pve and pvp in an open world  for horizon open you are allowed to  seamlessly jump into sessions with other  drivers for all things racing  games the battle royale mode eliminator  from forza horizon 4  and so much more without any pressure to  linger in the session  allowing you to stay for as long as you  like horizon tour also lets players jump  into races against average difficulty  drivatars  to capture all the aesthetic of a  regular car meet where players meet up  in the world to race  and have options to continue together to  the next tour location as well  now microsoft has pledged that all first  party games would get the red carpet  treatment when it comes to convenience  for gamers and forza horizon 5  is no exception crossplay and cross save  will both be available  and forza horizon 5 will also be  available on day one on xbox game pass  for the standard digital edition  seeing forza horizon 5 triumphantly give  that green light to all of this  might be one of the biggest reasons for  me to get absolutely psyched  there is so much to digest with this  game and what it offers and  everything from mexico's stunning  landscape to the redefined gameplay  modes  is sure to set forza horizon 5 apart  from its predecessors  in a fun new way let us know in the  comments if you are all so excited and  why  because i'd love to hear your thoughts  thanks for watching  [Music]  you
 

